{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"houfei-p0055","name":"郭浮","evidence":["houfei-q-p018"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"houfei-m-p018-houfei-p0055","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-p018"]},{"id":"houfei-m-o042-houfei-p0055","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-o042"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-o042","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-66c1f6044f4f1392a642","layer":"original","quote":"青龙三年春，后崩于许昌，以终制营陵。三月庚寅〖3〗，葬首阳陵西。﹝一﹞帝进表爵为观津侯，增邑五百，并前千户。迁详为驸马都尉〖4〗。四年〖5〗，追改封永为观津敬侯，世妇董为堂阳君；追封谥后兄浮为梁里亭戴侯，都为武城亭孝侯，成为新乐亭定侯：皆使使者奉策，祠以太牢。表薨，子详嗣；又分表爵，封详弟述为列侯。详薨，子钊嗣。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":202,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":157},{"id":"houfei-q-p018","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-b0ec71afc3d63350390f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》曰：“父永，官至南郡太守，谥敬侯。母姓董氏，即堂阳君，生三男二女：长男浮，高唐令；次女昱；次即后；后弟都；弟成。后以汉中平元年三月乙卯生，生而有异常。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5b9379ca0a7abcaa8429","start":0,"end":83}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
